# Commit Test Verification

Before running `git commit`, execute the relevant test suite for the changes.

For non-iOS changes, run `make test` from the repository root unless a more
specific test command is clearly more appropriate for the touched area.

For changes under `iosapp/`, do not run the iOS test suite before committing.
Those tests are too slow for the agent workflow and will be run manually by a
developer instead.
